04" end="00:39.524">in </span><span begin="00:39.524" end="00:39.996">this </span><span begin="00:39.996" end="00:41.780">round</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.197" end="00:49.908"><span begin="00:46.197" end="00:46.668">Oh </span><span begin="00:46.948" end="00:47.228">don't </span><span begin="00:47.228" end="00:47.540">come </span><span begin="00:47.540" end="00:48.055">closer </span><span begin="00:48.228" end="00:48.476">to </span><span begin="00:48.476" end="00:48.916">me </span><span begin="00:49.084" end="00:49.268">oh </span><span begin="00:49.268" end="00:49.428">my </span><span begin="00:49.428" end="00:49.781">boy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.908" end="00:55.252"><span begin="00:49.908" end="00:50.132">Heart </span><span begin="00:50.132" end="00:50.628">skipping </span><span begin="00:50.805" end="00:50.980">a </span><span begin="00:50.980" end="00:51.253">beat </span><span begin="00:51.396" end="00:51.700">but </span><span begin="00:51.700" end="00:51.900">I </span><span begin="00:51.900" end="00:52.188">won't </span><span begin="00:52.188" end="00:53.324">join</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.252" end="00:58.466"><span begin="00:55.252" end="00:56.366">Ooh </span><span begin="00:56.620" end="00:58.036">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.466" end="01:01.233"><span begin="00:58.466" end="00:58.689">You </span><span begin="00:58.689" end="00:59.433">already </span><span begin="00:59.690" end="00:59.905">had </span><span begin="00:59.905" end="01:00.241">me </span><span begin="01:00.241" end="01:00.449">at </span><span begin="01:00.449" end="01:01.049">hello</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.233" end="01:08.500"><span begin="01:01.233" end="01:01.480">But </span><span begin="01:01.480" end="01:01.786">my </span><span begin="01:01.786" end="01:02.346">feeling's </span><span begin="01:02.553" end="01:03.090">gonna </span><span begin="01:03.090" end="01:03.418">keep </span><span begin="01:03.418" end="01:04.629">cold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.500" end="01:10.828"><span begin="01:08.500" end="01:08.724">And </span><span begin="01:08.724" end="01:09.198">baby </span><span begin="01:09.198" end="01:09.892">please </span><span begin="01:09.892" end="01:10.636">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.828" end="01:14.004"><span begin="01:10.828" end="01:11.028">'Cause </span><span begin="01:11.028" end="01:11.388">my </span><span begin="01:11.388" end="01:11.780">heart </span><span begin="01:11.780" end="01:12.100">is </span><span begin="01:12.100" end="01:12.629">on </span><span begin="01:12.629" end="01:13.652">hold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.004" end="01:20.005"><span begin="01:14.004" end="01:14.332">My </span><span begin="01:14.332" end="01:14.636">mind </span><span begin="01:14.636" end="01:15.041">is </span><span begin="01:15.041" end="01:16.044">about </span><span begin="01:16.228" end="01:16.756">to </span><span begin="01:17.621" end="01:19.677">explode</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.005" end="01:22.956"><span begin="01:20.005" end="01:20.244">If </span><span begin="01:20.244" end="01:20.620">we </span><span begin="01:20.620" end="01:21.036">still </span><span begin="01:21.036" end="01:21.444">be </span><span begin="01:21.444" end="01:22.228">like </span><span begin="01:22.228" end="01:22.812">this</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.956" end="01:25.844"><span begin="01:22.956" end="01:23.131">Oh </span><span begin="01:23.131" end="01:23.549">baby </span><span begin="01:23.732" end="01:23.973">call </span><span begin="01:23.973" end="01:24.292">it </span><span begin="01:24.292" end="01:25.388">quit</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.844" end="01:33.364"><span begin="01:25.844" end="01:27.612">Everything </span><span begin="01:27.900" end="01:28.900">is </span><span begin="01:29.540" end="01:31.836">deluded</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.364" end="01:36.028"><span begin="01:33.364" end="01:33.676">Can't </sp